{"messageBody":"`bi = ["binstall", "--path", "<dir>", "ripgrep"]` was refused outside a
project. A bare word after a path value was taken as the tail of a value the
listing had split, but a subcommand external to Cargo takes positionals of
its own, and that is an ordinary invocation with nothing to verify.

